OL,3,A'Like cutting up a Picasso': AI
OL,4,Amicrodrama edit of Neighbours worries
OL,5,Aactors and crew
OL,6,
OL,7,FFormer Neighbours actors and crew have
OL,8,Fraised concerns about plans to use AI
OL,9,Fto help re-edit old footage and make
OL,10,Fmini episodes for mobile phone viewers.
OL,12,FFremantle, producer of the now-defunct
OL,13,FAustralian TV soap opera, has partnered
OL,14,Fwith US-based RoseBerry Media for the
OL,15,Fproject that will use AI to "scan
OL,16,Fdecades of episodes" to help make short
OL,17,Fvertical videos.
OL,19,FFootage of Margot Robbie, who played
OL,20,FDonna Freedman from 2008 to 2011, will
OL,21,Fbe the initial focus of the
OL,22,Fmicro-drama.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
