OL,3,A'Like cutting up a Picasso': AI
OL,4,Amicrodrama edit of Neighbours worries
OL,5,Aactors and crew
OL,6,
OL,7,FBoth companies say the move will bring
OL,8,Fthe show - which aired its final
OL,9,Fepisode last year - to new audiences.
OL,10,FBut some actors and crew say they have
OL,11,Fnot consented to their images, voice or
OL,12,Fwork to be re-purposed.
